function openCoupons(){const today=kstDate(new Date());commit(markCouponsSeen(state,today));dialog('보유 쿠폰',`${state.coupons.map(c=>{const status=couponStatus(c,today);return `<article class="wallet-ticket ${status==='available'?'':'unavailable'}"><div><span>${c.service==='shopping'?'장보기':'음식배달'} · ${esc(SHOPS.find(s=>s.id===c.shopId)?.name||'')}</span><b>${esc(c.title)}</b><p>${esc(c.description)}</p><small>발급 ${c.issuedAt} · ${c.expiresAt}까지</small></div>${status==='available'?`<button data-action="coupon-explore" data-coupon="${c.id}">쓸 수 있는 곳 보기 ›</button>`:`<strong>${status==='used'?'사용 완료':status==='expired'?'기간 만료':'발급 전'}</strong>`}</article>`;}).join('')}`);}
function openRecipe(recipeId){const recipe=RECIPES.find(r=>r.id===recipeId);if(!recipe)return;const suggestion=mealSuggestions(getCurrentReport(),CATALOG,SHOPS).find(s=>s.recipeId===recipeId);dialog(recipe.name,renderRecipeContent({recipe,catalog:CATALOG,coupons:state.coupons,date:kstDate(new Date()),thumb,icon,esc,money,reason:suggestion?.reason,adjustment:suggestion?.recipeAdjustment}));}
function addRecipe(recipeId){const recipe=RECIPES.find(r=>r.id===recipeId);if(!recipe)return;const finish=()=>{try{let next=cart;for(const l of recipe.items)next=addCart(next,CATALOG.find(m=>m.id===l.menuId),l.quantity);const c=state.coupons.find(c=>c.id===recipe.couponId);if(quoteCoupon(c,cartQuoteInput(next)).eligible)next.couponId=c.id;if(saveCart(next)){closeDialog();showShop(recipe.shopId);openCart();}}catch(error){notify(error.message);}};if(cart?.lines.length&&cart.shopId!==recipe.shopId){dialog('다른 가게의 장바구니가 있어요','<p>현재 장바구니를 비우고 집밥 재료를 담을까요?</p><button class="primary" id="replace-recipe-cart">비우고 재료 담기</button><button class="secondary" data-action="close">돌아가기</button>');$('#replace-recipe-cart').onclick=()=>{if(saveCart(null))finish();};}else finish();}
